# Centralized web UI config. Committed. Only VITE_-prefixed vars reach the browser.
#
# Feature availability:
#   - In DEVELOPMENT (`vite` / `vite dev`) EVERYTHING is enabled automatically and these
#     flags are IGNORED — you always get the full UI locally.
#   - In a PRODUCTION build (`vite build`) only what is listed here as enabled is available;
#     anything not set is OFF.
#
# Available in production (Agent (MCP) = the deployed-state diagram view):
VITE_AGENT_ENABLED=true
# Design & Deploy is not prod-ready yet — leave it off by NOT enabling it here.
# Uncomment when ready:
# VITE_DESIGN_ENABLED=true
